    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the chaos of everyday life and immerse yourself in the soothing world of Lost In Lofi, a cozy indie game designed to help you unwind and focus. In this chill, lo-fi inspired environment, you can grow a variety of plants, care for peaceful fish, and transform your room into the ultimate cozy space. Keep track of your real-life tasks by writing them down in-game and enjoy a serene atmosphere that helps you focus on completing them. Whether you're customizing your room or nurturing your virtual space, Lost In Lofi offers a calm escape where relaxation meets productivity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those who love lo-fi beats and cozy vibes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Try Your Paper Toss Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/b044e037ed10711347486fd0ccaa962c.poster.avif?t=1749004762\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/b044e037ed10711347486fd0ccaa962c.webm?t=1749004762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/b044e037ed10711347486fd0ccaa962c.mp4?t=1749004762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have your timers finished? Have a few minutes to kill? Instead of boring &quot;Placing paper in the bin&quot; how about have some fun and try your hand at tossing the paper ball into the bin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Grow Your Plants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/28dbf3a2693fbd2f65e2ca3b9e4003b9.poster.avif?t=1749004762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/28dbf3a2693fbd2f65e2ca3b9e4003b9.webm?t=1749004762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/28dbf3a2693fbd2f65e2ca3b9e4003b9.mp4?t=1749004762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have the option to plant many different plants of varying sizes throughout your room, customize them with a unique name and different coloured pot so you can remember which is which. You can make them special and plant one for each of your completed projects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Sticky Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/e0029fcb9c24a93e0f4885259606c040.poster.avif?t=1749004762\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/e0029fcb9c24a93e0f4885259606c040.webm?t=1749004762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/e0029fcb9c24a93e0f4885259606c040.mp4?t=1749004762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have an important task? Do you have deadlines? Need to keep track of something? Write it down on a sticky note in game, if it's important and you need it completed within a certain time, don't forget to add a timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Fish Tank</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/9ea4dd095fb776fb80a5a8d03d8f0d52.poster.avif?t=1749004762\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/9ea4dd095fb776fb80a5a8d03d8f0d52.webm?t=1749004762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/9ea4dd095fb776fb80a5a8d03d8f0d52.mp4?t=1749004762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your fish while you also care for your plants. You'll need to make sure the tank is clean and the fish are fed. Watch as they swim around while you relax to Lofi music.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the chaos of everyday life and immerse yourself in the soothing world of Lost In Lofi, a cozy indie game designed to help you unwind and focus. In this chill, lo-fi inspired environment, you can grow a variety of plants, care for peaceful fish, and transform your room into the ultimate cozy space. Keep track of your real-life tasks by writing them down in-game and enjoy a serene atmosphere that helps you focus on completing them. Whether you're customizing your room or nurturing your virtual space, Lost In Lofi offers a calm escape where relaxation meets productivity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those who love lo-fi beats and cozy vibes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Try Your Paper Toss Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/b044e037ed10711347486fd0ccaa962c.poster.avif?t=1749004762\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/b044e037ed10711347486fd0ccaa962c.webm?t=1749004762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/b044e037ed10711347486fd0ccaa962c.mp4?t=1749004762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have your timers finished? Have a few minutes to kill? Instead of boring &quot;Placing paper in the bin&quot; how about have some fun and try your hand at tossing the paper ball into the bin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Grow Your Plants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/28dbf3a2693fbd2f65e2ca3b9e4003b9.poster.avif?t=1749004762\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/28dbf3a2693fbd2f65e2ca3b9e4003b9.webm?t=1749004762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/28dbf3a2693fbd2f65e2ca3b9e4003b9.mp4?t=1749004762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have the option to plant many different plants of varying sizes throughout your room, customize them with a unique name and different coloured pot so you can remember which is which. You can make them special and plant one for each of your completed projects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Sticky Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/e0029fcb9c24a93e0f4885259606c040.poster.avif?t=1749004762\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646020/extras/e0029fcb9c24a93e0f4885259606c040.webm?t=174900476